  "question": {
    "en": "Many individuals use a prescription medication at some point during pregnancy. Examples include pain medications (codeine, hydrocodone), antidepressants (Celexa, Prozac), Sedatives (Xanax, Valium), Insulin, antibiotics (penicillin, Cipro), anti-fungal (miconazole), anti-nausea (zofran), anti-seizure (gabapentin, lamictal), antipsychotics (Zyprexa, Risperidone), mood stabilizers (lithium), stimulants (Adderall, Concerta), blood pressure medications (Vasotrec, Zestril), or sleeping agents (Ambien, Halcion). Since we last met did you take any prescription medications before the end of your pregnancy?"
